# CODEOWNERS
#
# Unity Loom is a single-maintainer project today, so every path is owned by
# the repository owner. The rules below are already grouped by the kind of
# change, so splitting them across a team later is a one-line edit per rule.
#
# Order matters: the first matching pattern wins, so the default rule comes
# first and the specific rules below refine it.

# Default owners: everything that no later rule claims.
*                                       @SparshKanodia

# The machine registry and the tooling that reads it.
manifest.json                           @SparshKanodia
tools/                                  @SparshKanodia
.github/                                @SparshKanodia

# The law. A change here touches every skill and every workflow.
doctrine/                               @SparshKanodia

# The shared tables: the claim registry, the XR dialect, the ledgers.
references/                             @SparshKanodia

# The skills and the workflows they own.
skills/                                 @SparshKanodia
workflows/                              @SparshKanodia

# The design record.
docs/                                   @SparshKanodia

# The contributor guide and the human entry points.
CONTRIBUTING.md                         @SparshKanodia
README.md                               @SparshKanodia
AGENTS.md                               @SparshKanodia
HARNESSES.md                            @SparshKanodia
